   "fy": "FY25",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -2,
   "q": "Although we expect the second half of the year to be weaker than the first, the Group's strong cash position, proven ability to adapt, and commitment to disciplined execution provide a solid foundation for future growth and a return to profitability in 2026.",
